WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:05.200
What happens when 1kg of ground&nbsp;
beef is placed inside of SCP-914?

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.480
Dr. Matism placed the meat into the Clockworks&nbsp;
on the setting “Fine,” and this was the output:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:15.120
“a model of an empty foothill, the words&nbsp;
Ground Beef are seared into the meat”

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:17.200
Dr. Matism then left a note saying,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:22.240
“Oh, ground as in the floor, ground&nbsp;
beef. This was utterly pointless.”

